Sound effects
-------------
No third-party sound files are bundled. Every effect is synthesised at build
time from a formula in `skills/promo-video/engine/promo_engine/sfx_synth.py`
(ffmpeg `aevalsrc`), so the effects are original to this project and covered
by its MIT licence. Earlier versions (v3, v4) bundled `renderer/public/sfx/*.mp3`
files of unverified provenance; they were removed in v5 and should not be
reused from git history for commercial work.

npm dependency
--------------
`cube-motion` (https://www.cube-motion.dev) — MIT. Used for the UI and typography
motion layer through `renderer/src/animations/cube.tsx`.

Runtime dependencies
--------------------
Remotion (https://remotion.dev) has its own licence terms, which may require a
company licence for commercial use. It is installed from npm, not redistributed here.

The optional `watch` skill (https://github.com/bradautomates/claude-video, MIT) is
installed separately by the user and invoked, not bundled.
